    {
      "id": "h3_promotion_gate_20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# H3 晋级入口｜674-260\\n\\n200+头像不是200+角色：先去重/身份聚类。\\nL1 LOCKED → L2 BODY PASS → L3 CANON PASS → CHARACTER_H3_CARD + PRODUCTION_PACK → READY_FOR_H3 → 674-216\\n\\nH3 禁止直接消费散头像。\\n当前首包：H04 READY_FOR_H3。",
