    {
      "id": "role_z_bridge_in_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 问题系统接头\n\n上游：[[../../00_总览/黎黎隆问题系统.canvas]] → G2｜角色稳定 / CORE_Z\n\n输入：parent_z / relation_type / authority / path / blocker / priority\n输出：achievement / verified_xn_fit / unresolved_nx / evidence / done_status\n\nLinear：674-276 / 674-280 / 674-116",
      "x": -2700,
      "y": -390,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_role_l1_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Z-ROLE-L1｜身份 / 视觉核心\n\n目标：这个角色是谁？主视觉锚是否锁定？\nHuman-in-NX：最高\n\nR2 角色判断 + R3 视觉判断\n\nDONE：identity_core / 主参考 / 头脸年龄轮廓 / 关键结构可验证。",
      "x": -1950,
      "y": -390,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_role_l2_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Z-ROLE-L2｜多视图 / 身体结构\n\n目标：四宫格、中景、中全景、全身不漂移。\n重点：proportion / costume / special structure / cross-view identity\nHuman-in-NX：中等\n\nR3 视觉判断 + R4 生产闭环。",
      "x": -1950,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_role_l3_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Z-ROLE-L3｜Canon / 世界职责\n\n目标：角色成为世界观内可使用的正式正本。\n重点：world_role / behavior / home_region / story_hook / event_capability\nHuman-in-NX：低频高权力\n\nR2 角色判断 + R4 生产闭环。",
      "x": -1950,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "role_z_shared_packet_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 每个 Z 独立控制包\nlocal_xn_set\nnx_gaps\nauthority_state\npath_state\nexpected_xn_fit\nverified_xn_fit\ndone_condition\n\nH3_READY = 下游资格，不属于三个 Z 本体。",
      "x": -1370,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ag07_h3_problem_gate_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AG-07｜H3代理（问题系统化）\n\n只消费 READY_FOR_H3。\n角色三个Z完成不是“结束”，而是把已冻结角色包交给 H3 子Z。\n\nH3知识全部归入：XN / NX / PATH / EVIDENCE。\n详细：[[../../00_总览/H3视频生产问题.canvas]]\n\n禁止：从散头像直接进视频；禁止 H3 用 prompt 修复上游角色 Canon。",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "role_282_module_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 282｜角色 XN+Z 实验对象层\n\nMERGED INTO 276，不另建第二套总控。\n\nZ1 实验对象来源\n→ Z2 素材标准化 / 154\n→ Z3 机器审核；异常→173\n→ Z4 FAIL→125 / PASS→NPC / 核心→核心池\n→ Z5 NX→candidate XN\n→ Z6 Base回写→新Z\n\n映射：\nZ1/Z3→L1\nZ2/Z4→L2\nZ5/Z6→L1/L2/L3\n\n默认 AUTO_CONTINUE。",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
